---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import heroImage from "@/assets/hero.png";
---

<main
  class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 place-items-center pt-8 pb-8 md:pt-12 md:pb-24">
  <div class="py-6 w-full max-w-md mx-auto lg:max-w-none lg:order-1">
    <Picture
      src={heroImage}
      alt="Astronaut in the air"
      widths={[200, 400, 600]}
      sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 90vw, 620px"
      loading="eager"
      format="avif"
      class="w-full h-auto"
    />
  </div>
  <div>
    <h1
      class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight xl:tracking-tighter">
      Run Faster Together.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-xl">
      Academy of Speed is a community of runners driven to improve, compete and reach their full potential.
With expert coaching, purposeful training and a team that pushes each other forward, we turn ambition into performance.
    </p>
  </div>
</main>
